          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi abantu epakuyako, bayasenda ifya mabula no kusakila insakwe cila umo pa mulu wa mutenge wa ŋanda yakwe, mu mansa sha mayanda yabo, na mu mansa sha ŋanda yakwa Lesa, na mu lubansa lwa ku Mpongolo ya Menshi, elyo na mu lubansa lwa ku Mpongolo yakwa Efulemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi emukutila bonse abantu ababwelele ukufuma muli bunkole basakile insakwe no kwikalamo. Kabili bali abasansamuka pantu tacabalile acicitikapo ukufuma ku nshiku shakwa Yoshua mwana Nuni. Awe umuntu onsefye ali ne nsansa ishikalamba nganshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
